  <result type="3">
   <title>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthen the Global Anti-Corruption Consortium&#x2019;s work in Africa to combat corruption and bring about more accountable governance essential to 
sustainable development</narrative>
   </title>
   <reference code="279204" vocabulary="99"></reference>
   <indicator aggregation-status="0" ascending="1" measure="1">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Increased capacity for high impact investigations as evidenced by number of stakeholders involved in the Global Anti-Corruption Consortium</narrative>
    </title>
    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2022-01-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2022-12-31"></period-end>
     <target value="Up to 6 new African partners, including both investigative reporting centers and civil society advocacy organizations, actively engaged in investigative reporting or advocacy work"></target>
     <actual value="10 new working relationships developed in 2022:

OCCRP developed significant working relationhips with three new centers - in Mali (1), Niger (2) and Zimbabwe (3), and individial journalists in Burkina Faso, Seychelles and Comoros (4-6). Also with an international CSO working with whistleblowers in Africa (7).

TI report: 3 new collaborations with NGOs regarding GACC work in Africa - based in Gabon (8), the UK (9), and the DRC (10).&quot;"></actual>
    </period>
    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2020-01-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2020-12-31"></period-end>
     <target value="End year target 2022."></target>
     <actual value="2 - 1 new OCCRP member center in South Africa and 1 new TI partner in The Gambia"></actual>
    </period>
    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2019-01-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2019-12-31"></period-end>
     <target value="End year target 2022."></target>
     <actual value="2 new member centers"></actual>
    </period>
    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2021-01-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2021-12-31"></period-end>
     <target value="End year target 2022."></target>
     <actual value="4 significant new partnerships, but 14 new collaborations -  2 new OCCRP media partners (in South Africa and Liberia), 2 new TI partners (in Namibia, and focused on Equatorial Guinea), but see details on implementation for more"></actual>
    </period>
   </indicator>
  </result>
